Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains NO third-party LaTeX template files.

The extension downloads class, style and bibliography-style files at runtime,
directly from the publishers that distribute them, and writes them into the
user's own Overleaf project. It does not redistribute them, and the MIT licence
above does not apply to them. Each remains under its own terms:

  acmart.cls, ACM-Reference-Format.bst, acm*.bbx/.cbx/.dbx
      Copyright ACM / Boris Veytsman. LaTeX Project Public License (LPPL).
      Fetched from https://www.acm.org/publications/proceedings-template

  IEEEtran.cls, IEEEtran.bst
      Copyright Michael Shell. LaTeX Project Public License (LPPL).
      Fetched from CTAN.

  llncs.cls, splncs04.bst
      Copyright Springer-Verlag. Distributed under Springer's own terms.
      Fetched from CTAN.

  elsarticle
      Copyright Elsevier. Detected and reported only; never downloaded or
      modified by this tool.

The test suite likewise fetches these files on demand into a gitignored
directory rather than vendoring them (see test/fixtures.js).

